---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="AI & Operations" description="Darshan Kansara's practical approach to AI-enabled operations: bounded assistance, visible evidence, and accountable human decisions.">
  <header class="page-hero">
    <p class="eyebrow">AI &amp; operations</p>
    <div><h1>Useful intelligence has boundaries.</h1><p>AI is valuable when it improves the signal inside a real operating system. It is dangerous when confidence hides missing evidence or ownership.</p></div>
  </header>

  <section class="premise">
    <p class="index">01 · Operating premise</p>
    <div><h2>Operations first.<br />AI where it helps.</h2><p>Twenty-five years around infrastructure, incidents, capacity, reliability, and cost shaped the starting point: understand the decision, its evidence, and its consequence before choosing the model.</p></div>
  </section>

  <section class="uses" aria-labelledby="uses-title">
    <div class="uses-heading"><p class="index">02 · Useful territory</p><h2 id="uses-title">Four places where better signal changes the work.</h2></div>
    <div class="matrix">
      <article><span>01</span><h3>RCA acceleration</h3><p>Connect incident timelines, telemetry, and recurring patterns to narrow likely cause areas without presenting correlation as certainty.</p></article>
      <article><span>02</span><h3>Runbook assistance</h3><p>Retrieve attributable operating knowledge inside the workflow, then show the source and boundary behind each suggested step.</p></article>
      <article><span>03</span><h3>Decision support</h3><p>Bring relevant context into a workflow while keeping the consequential choice visible.</p></article>
      <article><span>04</span><h3>Cost intelligence</h3><p>Detect anomalies and forecast pressure early enough for engineering action.</p></article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="rules">
    <p class="index">03 · Design rules</p>
    <ol><li><span>Evidence</span><strong>Make telemetry visible, searchable, and attributable.</strong></li><li><span>Boundaries</span><strong>Say what the system cannot know.</strong></li><li><span>Control</span><strong>Keep consequential action with the person.</strong></li><li><span>Feedback</span><strong>Make correction part of the operating loop.</strong></li></ol>
  </section>

  <section class="proof"><div><p class="index">Applied in products</p><h2>The principles become real under product constraints.</h2></div><nav aria-label="Related product stories"><a href="/lifelens"><strong>LifeLens</strong><span>Private, on-device photo intelligence &rarr;</span></a><a href="/applyready"><strong>ApplyReady</strong><span>Evidence-led role analysis &rarr;</span></a></nav></section>

  <style>
    :global(body){background:#0b1220}.eyebrow,.index,.matrix span,.rules li span{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:.64rem;letter-spacing:.11em;text-transform:uppercase}.eyebrow,.index{color:#75b7fb}.page-hero{padding:clamp(72px,9vw,118px) max(var(--pad),calc((100vw - var(--max))/2));display:grid;grid-template-columns:190px 1fr;gap:clamp(32px,7vw,98px);background:#0b1220;color:#fff;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12)}.page-hero h1{max-width:12ch;color:#f5f3ed;font-size:clamp(3.2rem,6vw,6rem);line-height:.94;letter-spacing:-.045em}.page-hero div>p{max-width:55ch;color:#9eacbd;font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:clamp(1.05rem,1.7vw,1.3rem)}.premise,.uses,.rules,.proof{padding:clamp(76px,9vw,126px) max(var(--pad),calc((100vw - var(--max))/2));background:#0b1220;color:#aeb9c8;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1)}.premise{display:grid;grid-template-columns:190px 1fr;gap:clamp(32px,7vw,98px)}.premise h2,.uses h2,.proof h2{color:#f3f1ed;font-size:clamp(2.3rem,4.1vw,3.8rem);line-height:1.04;letter-spacing:-.035em}.premise div>p{max-width:65ch;color:#9eacbd;font-size:1.05rem}.uses-heading{display:grid;grid-template-columns:190px 1fr;gap:clamp(32px,7vw,98px)}.uses-heading h2{max-width:16ch}.matrix{width:min(var(--max),100%);margin:64px auto 0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.14);border-left:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.14)}.matrix article{min-height:245px;padding:25px 22px;border-right:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.14);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.14);display:flex;flex-direction:column}.matrix span{color:#75b7fb}.matrix h3{margin-top:auto;color:#edf1f5;font-size:1.08rem}.matrix p{color:#8f9daf;font-size:.86rem;margin:0}.rules{display:grid;grid-template-columns:190px 1fr;gap:clamp(32px,7vw,98px)}.rules ol{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.14)}.rules li{display:grid;grid-template-columns:150px 1fr;gap:30px;padding:25px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.14)}.rules li span{color:#c6a15a}.rules li strong{color:#e6ebf1;font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:clamp(1.1rem,2vw,1.45rem)}.proof{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:clamp(44px,8vw,110px);background:#101d31}.proof h2{max-width:16ch}.proof nav{display:grid;align-content:end}.proof a{display:grid;gap:5px;padding:22px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.16)}.proof a:last-child{border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.16)}.proof strong{color:#fff;font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:1.25rem}.proof a span{color:#8fc3f7;font-size:.86rem}
    @media(max-width:800px){.page-hero,.premise,.uses-heading,.rules,.proof{grid-template-columns:1fr}.page-hero,.premise,.rules{gap:24px}.matrix{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}}@media(max-width:520px){.matrix{grid-template-columns:1fr}.matrix article{min-height:160px}.rules li{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:8px}}
  </style>
  <style>
    :global(body){background:var(--ink)}
    .page-hero,.premise,.uses,.rules,.proof{background:transparent;color:var(--text);border-color:var(--line);grid-template-columns:var(--rail) 1fr}
    .page-hero{min-height:64vh;align-items:end;padding-top:var(--section);padding-bottom:var(--section)}
    .eyebrow,.index,.matrix span,.rules li span{letter-spacing:.08em}.eyebrow,.index{color:var(--gold)}
    .page-hero h1{color:var(--paper);font-size:clamp(3.4rem,7.2vw,7.2rem);font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:.87}
    .page-hero div>p,.premise div>p{color:var(--muted);font-family:var(--font-sans)}
    .premise h2,.uses h2,.proof h2{color:var(--paper);font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0}
    .matrix{border-color:var(--line)}.matrix article{position:relative;border-color:var(--line);background:rgba(233,229,218,.015)}.matrix article::before{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0 0 auto;height:2px;background:var(--azure);transform:scaleX(0);transform-origin:left;transition:transform .3s ease}.matrix article:hover::before{transform:scaleX(1)}
    .matrix span{color:var(--gold)}.matrix h3{color:var(--paper);font-family:var(--font-sans);font-weight:500}.matrix p{color:var(--muted)}
    .rules ol,.rules li{border-color:var(--line)}.rules li span{color:var(--azure)}.rules li strong{color:var(--paper);font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:400}
    .proof nav,.proof nav a{border-color:var(--line)}.proof nav a:hover{background:var(--surface)}.proof nav strong{color:var(--paper)}.proof nav span{color:var(--muted)}
    @media(max-width:800px){.page-hero{min-height:auto}.page-hero,.premise,.uses-heading,.rules,.proof{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
  </style>
</Base>